OL,3,AFour killed and dozens seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in major fire at Canadian
OL,5,Amilitary base, Carney says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour service members have been killed
OL,8,Fand dozens wounded after a fire at a
OL,9,FCanadian military base, Prime Minister
OL,10,FMark Carney says
OL,12,FCarney says it's "one of the worst
OL,13,Ftragedies" for the military in
OL,14,Fpeacetime, as he describes a "violent,
OL,15,Ffast-moving" fire on Saturday
OL,17,FThe fire is now contained, but rescue
OL,18,Fteams remain at the scene to prevent
OL,19,Fany potential flare-up, a mayor tells
OL,20,Fthe BBC
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
